{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/knedg7u1","slide":4,"text":"Strong fit for conflicting financial writes. Waits can throttle hot accounts.","textPreview":"Strong fit for conflicting financial writes. Waits can throttle hot accounts.","textChars":77,"textLines":1,"bbox":[80,501,490,72]}
