{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/p8qk0r","slide":10,"text":"Close by summarizing the transfer lifecycle: authenticate and authorize, deduplicate retries, lock and update both accounts atomically, record event intent in the outbox, then publish with at-least-once semantics. Invite questions about lock contention, idempotency guarantees, and the outbox trade-off."}